---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout>
  <section>
    <h2>Experience</h2>

    <article class="nested">
      <div class="timeline">
        <time title="1 yr 6 mos" datetime="P 518D">
          May 2018 &mdash; Oct 2019
        </time>
        <span>Napoleon Games</span>
      </div>
      <div class="details">
        <h3>Full Stack/Java Developer</h3>
        <p>
          INTIX helps financial institutions become data centric. INTIX
          addresses the challenges faced by financial institutions such as
          accessing and consolidating transaction data from multiple internal
          systems and delivering the appropriate analytics and insights. Thanks
          to real-time access to transaction details, the INTIX technology
          provides end-to-end business activity monitoring which serves
          transaction processing operations as well as enhances detection of
          internal fraud.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside>
        <ul>
          <li>Adobe AEM</li>
          <li>Spring Boot</li>
          <li>Java 8</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
